# dripmetric.com — the one value to set before going live. It is read at build time,
# so the site needs a rebuild after it changes.
# Copy this file to .env.local to try it locally; set it in the hosting provider for deploys.

# An HTTPS endpoint that accepts a form POST with an "email" field (Formspree, Loops,
# Buttondown, Tally, your own API...). Fields sent: email, source.
# Empty: "Join the waitlist" opens a pre-filled email to hello@dripmetric.com.
# The full contract is in README.md, "Before you deploy".
NEXT_PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=
